## Conclusion

This project demonstrates how to build an event-driven automation workflow using n8n Webhooks. The workflow accepts form submissions, validates the input, stores the information in Google Sheets, and automatically sends a confirmation email. It shows how multiple services can work together to automate a complete data collection process.

